e_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.dev5\n- Older versions do not have Shader Baker.\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev5 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700KF (20 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using Shader Baker on Export settings for Android **everything goes fine on the first export,** but if you **export again it fails** with the error in the image below.\n\nIf you delete the folder `.godot\\export` it will export again, but you have to do it every single time.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/226cccff-1984-4223-b30e-7b4c6fa000d7)\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Set up your environment for Android Export according Godot's documentation.\n- Enable Shader Baker.\n- Export the project for the first time, everything will work fine.\n- Export the project for the second time, it will fail.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[reflection-probe-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20738396/reflection-probe-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rep